Use case: ui-mockup editing. Reformat this existing Wealth Life Chinese study-progress screen into an elegant LONG VERTICALLY SCROLLING mobile page preview, NOT a whole tall page squeezed into a single short viewport. Target portrait aspect approximately 1:2.7 to1:3 (e.g.1024x2816). User explicitly allows scrolling down. Keep original cozy warm crayon/colored-pencil cream-paper/forest-green/gold game design. Preserve top classroom/home-study illustration and its natural undistorted proportions; no stretched faces or flattened objects. Increase breathing room and normal readable typography/button heights instead of cramming everything into reference's current short height. Header illustration around top20–25%, not an enormous empty hero. Consistent full-width paper sections, margins about40px at1024 width, text normal proportions. Within progress card, keep chart compact and remaining months directly beneath bar, no big empty gap. Between major sections allow36–48px, between lines16–24px. Buttons around90–105px high, never vertically compressed. Do not insert giant blank bottom. No phone frame, no browser chrome, one continuous page intended to scroll.
Exact content and state MUST remain:
top back 返回房屋, header 学习进度;
正在就读 · 本科, 高中直读本科, 轻松学习;
progress 0 / 72 个月, 预计还需 72 个月;
section 本月学习安排: 学习预留 40 小时, 剩余自由时间 60 小时;
section 学费缴纳: 课程总费用 $30,300, 已缴学费 $420.83, 剩余学费 $29,879.17. Arrange these3 rows vertically to avoid cramped columns, with left labels and right amounts.
status 本月学费 $420.83 · 已缴清;
disabled pale sage gray-green button 本月学费已缴清;
helper 含学杂费及必需书籍费;
notice 本月学费已缴清，可以进入城镇;
outline button 更改学习安排;
helper 40 / 60 小时可切换，下月生效;
notice 开始学习后不可暂停或退出;
gold bottom button 返回房屋;
small footer 设计预览 · 示例数据.
No changed money values or months, no new effects/fee/dates/interest, no pause/withdraw buttons, no new prose. Use reference only for visual identity and correct content; improve composition by lengthening the page, not shrinking text or illustration. Keep numeric glyphs clean and readable. Each portrait must feel like a natural long app page rather than a compacted poster.

